-- Thebes · Wordle on a flat, full-colour player (the second family). The panel is the whole page: a colour field with
-- the sponsor's name running round all four edges, the sponsor's panel at the top, a big title, three readouts (time,
-- best, streak), the screen and the key deck. Flat colour, thick ink outlines, no light.
-- Build: node bin/gt.js build examples/games/pop-player.gt --engine game

-- what changes from one challenge to the next
Let the word be "toast".
Let the tries be 6.
Let the time be 180 s.
Let the series be "mamas-daily".
Let ink be #1a0d2e.
Let field be #1f8bff.
Let band be #ffd21f.
Let sponsor be #ff5a47.
Let glass be #ffe3ea.
Let deck be #10d27a.

Let there be a flat canvas called pop-player, 1080 by 1920.
Set the bench to #1f8bff.
Let text be in Big Shoulders Display bold, size 40.

-- the field
Let there be a rectangle called field, 1080 by 1920, at 540 960.
Make the field field.

-- the sponsor's name, round all four edges
Let there be a rectangle called band-top, 1080 by 84, at 540 42.
Let there be a rectangle called band-bottom, 1080 by 84, at 540 1878.
Let there be a rectangle called band-left, 84 by 1920, at 42 960.
Let there be a rectangle called band-right, 84 by 1920, at 1038 960.
Make the band-top, the band-bottom, the band-left and the band-right band.
Give the band-top, the band-bottom, the band-left and the band-right an outline in ink, 6 wide.
Write "MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER" called name-top, size 44, tracking 4, in the band-top.
Write "MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER" called name-bottom, size 44, tracking 4, in the band-bottom.
Write "MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER" called name-left, size 44, tracking 4, turned -90, in the band-left.
Write "MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER  •  MAMA'S DINER" called name-right, size 44, tracking 4, turned 90, in the band-right.
Make the name-top, the name-bottom, the name-left and the name-right ink.

-- the sponsor's panel
Let there be a rectangle called sponsor-panel, 860 by 184, at 540 188.
Make the sponsor-panel sponsor.
Give the sponsor-panel an outline in ink, 6 wide.
Let there be a rectangle called sponsor-bar, 860 by 40, in the sponsor-panel, at the top.
Make the sponsor-bar ink.
Write "PRESENTED BY" called presented in Martian Mono, size 20, tracking 8, in the sponsor-bar.
Make the presented band.
Write "MAMA'S DINER" called brand, size 106, tracking 6, in the sponsor-panel, at the bottom, 20 in.
Make the brand glass.

-- the title
Write "THE DAILY WORD" called title, size 92, tracking 4, at 540 378.
Make the title white.
Write "No. 001  ·  SIX TRIES  ·  THREE MINUTES" called subtitle in Martian Mono, size 22, tracking 5, under the title, 14 apart.
Make the subtitle band.

-- the readouts
Let there be a rectangle called time-box, 270 by 76, at 236 528.
Let there be a rectangle called best-box, 270 by 76, at 540 528.
Let there be a rectangle called streak-box, 270 by 76, at 844 528.
Make the time-box, the best-box and the streak-box glass.
Give the time-box, the best-box and the streak-box an outline in ink, 5 wide.
Write "TIME" called time-label in Martian Mono, size 18, tracking 6, above the time-box, 10 apart.
Write "BEST" called best-label in Martian Mono, size 18, tracking 6, above the best-box, 10 apart.
Write "STREAK" called streak-label in Martian Mono, size 18, tracking 6, above the streak-box, 10 apart.
Make the time-label, the best-label and the streak-label white.

-- the screen
Let there be a rectangle called screen, 860 by 864, at 540 1022.
Make the screen glass.
Give the screen an outline in ink, 6 wide.
Let there be a rectangle called screen-bar, 860 by 40, in the screen, at the top.
Make the screen-bar ink.
Let there be a rectangle called glass, 840 by 810, at 540 1041.
Make the glass glass.

-- the key deck
Let there be a rectangle called deck, 900 by 320, at 540 1648.
Make the deck deck.
Give the deck an outline in ink, 6 wide.

-- the game
Play wordle on the glass, with the keyboard on the deck.
Every tile is white, with ink letters, in Big Shoulders Display, flat, outlined in ink, 5 wide, corners 4.
A correct tile is #10d27a.
A present tile is #ffd21f.
An absent tile is #9aa3c2, with white letters.
Every key is white, with ink letters, in Big Shoulders Display, raised, outlined in ink, 3 wide, corners 8.
A correct key is #10d27a.
A present key is #ffd21f.
An absent key is #9aa3c2, with white letters.
Every readout is ink, in Big Shoulders Display.
An urgent readout is #ff3b30.
Show the timer on the time-box.
Show the best on the best-box.
Show the streak on the streak-box.
When the game is won, say "Lunch is on us. Show this at the counter.".
When the time runs out, say "Time! Come back tomorrow.".
